  m_text: "The horse (Equus ferus caballus) is a domesticated, hoofed herbivorous
    mammal from the family Equidae, featuring a long mane, tail, and solid hoofs.
    Evolving over 55 million years, they were domesticated around 4000\u20136000
    BCE in Central Asia. Known for intelligence and social herd behavior, horses
    are used globally for riding, work, sport, and companionship."
